        "Description": "These four people are part of Abiatti&apos;s spy ring. Ricardo is spying on the party members, freddie is working with Ricardo. Roberto runs the process of identifying each person, and Christina works as a cover. Eliminate them, and then we can eliminate the leader Abiatti himself!",
